  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LO TCO Allocation Reform East 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LO-TCO Bist&#xe5;ndsn&#xe4;mnd Ramanslag &#xd6;st 2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LO-TCO Bist&#xe5;ndsn&#xe4;mnde &#xe4;r ett paraplyorgan med syfte att distribuera   Sidas CSO &#xd6;stmedel till fackf&#xf6;reningsr&#xf6;relsen. Medlen kanaliseras     normalt via ett svenskt fackf&#xf6;rbund och dess International (Global    Union Federation)till Fackliga akt&#xf6;rer i &#xf6;steuropa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The LO-TCO Secretariat is an Umbrella Body with the mission to        distribute the Sida Reform East allocation to the Union movement      actors. The fund are normally distibuted through a Swedish Federatio  and it&apos;s Global Union Federation to a Union actor in a &quot;Reform East&quot;  country</narrative>
  </description>
